iljøet) [1].\n* **E-post:** Avsender på epost: **noreply@altinn** (**noreply-tt02@altinn.no** for testmiljøet og **noreply@altinn.cloud** for ytelsestestmiljøet) [1].\n\nKildene spesifiserer at avsendervariabelen varierer basert på hvilket miljø (produksjon, test eller ytelsestest) meldingen sendes fra, slik det fremgår av ovenstående oppsplitting [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-notif-07-standard-avsender-sms-epost", :empty? false, :llm-calls 4, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 701, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB+read-hi", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-notifications,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d286593dbb706 R25.3 P3.6 h3.0 or2.0 L774 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Custom sender", :response-chars 526, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "1ae507a826c4;e1367aa78b19;aa73725749c0", :enrichment-hits 56, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 10217, :pool-head "", :repeat 2, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "1ae507a826c4", :expected-chunk-ids "1ae507a826c4", :elapsed-ms 225900, :issued-queries "altinn varsling sms avsender | altinn varsling postkasse avsender adresse | variabler i altinn meldinger", :timestamp "2026-06-11T16:30:56.897262Z", :total-tokens 10918, :run-id "d01cb5ef-5a7d-4015-9a8e-028da379564e", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Basert på konteksten er **aktivitetsloggen** en uforanderlig liste over tidsstemplede oppføringer av forskjellige typer som viser historikken gjennom en bestemt dialogs levetid [1]. Den inneholder informasjon om tidligere aktiviteter knyttet til dialogen, for eksempel opprettelsen av dialogen, meldinger sendt fra tjenesteeieren, data innsendt av parten, utførte signaturer eller betalinger, samt åpne forsendelser [1].\n\nDet er **tjenesteeieren** som fyller ut aktivitetsloggen og er ansvarlig for dette [1]. Tjenesteeieren bør registrere oppføringene i forbindelse med andre endringer som gjøres i dialogen [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-dialog-01-aktivitetslogg", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 420, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dfd39a68c8de7 R22.5 P3.6 h3.0 or1.7 L2058 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Activity log", :response-chars 613, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :enrichment-hits 37, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8245, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :expected-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :elapsed-ms 213274, :issued-queries "aktivitetslogg dialogportalen | aktivitetslogg dialog | dialogportalen hvem fyller ut aktivitetsslog", :timestamp "2026-06-11T16:32:02.700622Z", :total-tokens 8665, :run-id "3d2428e3-2fd4-4153-a5ad-d7321a4b8c0e", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Basert på konteksten er aktivitetsloggen i Dialogporten en uforanderlig liste over tidsstemplede oppføringer, hver av en bestemt type, som viser historikken gjennom en bestemt dialogs levetid [1]. Loggen fyller ut med informasjon om tidligere aktiviteter knyttet til den spesifikke dialogen, for eksempel opprettelsen av dialogen, meldinger sendt fra tjenesteeieren, data innlevert av parten, samt fullførte signaturer eller betalinger [1].\n\nDet er **tjenesteeieren** som har ansvaret og fyller ut aktivitetsloggen [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-dialog-01-aktivitetslogg", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 461, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB+read-hi", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dfd39a68c8de7 R24.4 P3.5 h3.0 or1.0 L2058 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Activity log", :response-chars 519, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :enrichment-hits 68, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8380, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :expected-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :elapsed-ms 229925, :issued-queries "aktivitetslogg dialogport | hva er aktivitetslogg | aktivitetlogg bruk av dialogport | dialogport oppgave mottaker leverandør", :timestamp "2026-06-11T16:33:17.808048Z", :total-tokens 8841, :run-id "2a084049-1e4c-47b1-ab4d-ce4c35df250b", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Aktivitetsloggen til en dialog i Dialogporten defineres som en **uforanderlig liste over tidsstemplede oppføringer**, hver av en bestemt type, som viser historikken gjennom hele dialogens levetid [1]. Hver aktivitet representerer en konkret handling eller hendelse knyttet til dialogen, for eksempel at den ble opprettet, at tjenesteeieren sendte en melding, at parten leverte inn data, at det skjedde en signatur/betalning, eller at et dokument (forsendelse) har blitt åpnet [1]. En aktivitet beskrives generelt som nettopp en handling/hendelse i dialogens tilstandshistorikk [2].\n\nDet er **tjenesteeieren** som har ansvaret for å fylle ut aktivitetsloggen, og dette bør gjøres samlet med andre endringer man gjør på dialogen [1]. \n\n*Merk vedrørende rollebenevnelse:* Mens den tekniske referansen i kildeteksten tydelig bruker begrepet `tjenesteeieren` for å identifisere ansvarlig part, nevnes det også at `Tjenesteleverandøren` fyller aktivitetshistorikken ved tilstandsendringer [2]. Dette viser sannsynligvis til samme funksjon i plattformen, men kildene bruker litt ulike terminologier.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-dialog-01-aktivitetslogg", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 440, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dfd39a68c8de7 R24.0 P3.6 h3.0 or2.1 L2058 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Activity log", :response-chars 1092, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 2, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96;294db2090e8b", :enrichment-hits 42, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 8075, :pool-head "de8985669f0ad R24.8 P3.5 h3.0 or1.1 L618 8/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Dialogs", :repeat 1, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96;294db2090e8b", :expected-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :elapsed-ms 230973, :issued-queries "aktivitetslogg dialog i Dialogporten | aktivitetslogg fylles ut av hvem", :timestamp "2026-06-11T16:34:47.872913Z", :total-tokens 8515, :run-id "92617727-bfea-45d8-9ffd-b78f98df9233", :golden-display-rank 2, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Basert på konteksten er aktivitetsloggen til en dialog i Dialogporten en uforanderlig liste over tidsstemplede oppføringer, hver av en bestemt type, som viser historikken gjennom hele dialogens levetid [1]. Oppføringene representerer bestemte aktiviteter som f.eks. opprettelsen av dialogen, en melding sendt fra tjenesteeieren, data innsendt av parten, signatur eller betaling, samt åpning av forsendelser [1].\n\nDet er **tjenesteeieren** som har ansvaret og som fyller ut aktivitetsloggen med informasjon om tidligere aktiviteter knyttet til den aktuelle dialogen [1]. Tjenesteeieren bør oppdatere loggen i forbindelse med andre endringer som gjøres i dialogen [1]. \n\n*Merk:* Det skal ikke legges egne aktivitetslogg-oppføringer ved tillegg av forsendelser, siden forsendelseslisten allerede er uforanderlig og fungerer som en egen logg; frontend skal imidlertid aggregere både aktivitetsloggen og forsendelseslisten (samt sett-loggen) for å gi en fullstendig kronologi over dialogens historie [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-dialog-01-aktivitetslogg", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 396, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB+read-hi", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dfd39a68c8de7 R23.2 P3.6 h3.0 or1.7 L2058 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Activity log", :response-chars 999, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :enrichment-hits 45, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8096, :pool-head "", :repeat 1, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :expected-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :elapsed-ms 249942, :issued-queries "aktivitetslogg dialogportal | dialog aktivitet logging fyller ut | Dialogporten arbeidsflyt aktivitet", :timestamp "2026-06-11T16:36:12.645011Z", :total-tokens 8492, :run-id "5ab7d71b-826f-47fe-8ee5-deef85346857", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Basert på den oppgitte konteksten er **aktivitetsloggen** for en dialog i Dialogporten en uforanderlig liste over tidsstemplede oppføringer av bestemt type som viser historikken gjennom hele dialogens levetid [1]. Loggen dokumenterer tidligere aktiviteter knyttet til den spesifikke dialogen, slik som:\n- Opprettelsen av dialogen [1]\n- Meldinger sendt fra tjenesteeieren eller data innlevert av parten [1]\n- Gjennomførte signaturer og betalinger [1]\n- Åpning (og/eller bekreftet lesing) av forsendelser, selv om selve forsendelseslisten er uforanderlig i seg selv [1].\n\nDet er **tjenesteeieren** som har ansvaret for å fylle ut aktivitetsloggen, og det bør gjøres parallelt med andre endringer på dialogen [1]. \n\n*(Merk: I tillegg til «aktivitetslogg» omtaler kilden også et relatert begrep under navnet `_aktivitetshistorikken_`, som defineres som en kronologisk liste over aktiviteter hvor tjenesteleverandøren registrerer tilstandsendringer fortløpende [2]. Begrunnelsen i spørsmålet tilsvarer direkte definisjonen av «aktivitetslogg» fra kilde [1], men det kan være verdt å merke seg at de to begrepene brukes litt skiftevis i dokumentasjonen.)*", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-dialog-01-aktivitetslogg", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 423, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dfd39a68c8de7 R23.6 P3.5 h3.0 or0.9 L2058 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Activity log", :response-chars 1149, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96;294db2090e8b", :enrichment-hits 47, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 8193, :pool-head "", :repeat 2, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96;294db2090e8b", :expected-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :elapsed-ms 244854, :issued-queries "hva er aktivitetsloggen til en dialog i dialogporten og hvem fyller den ut | aktivitetslogg dialogport | dialogport aktivitet logg utfyller", :timestamp "2026-06-11T16:37:22.666882Z", :total-tokens 8616, :run-id "2bbd5aa0-4f50-4fc3-8c5b-d15ce91f6adc", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Basert på konteksten er **aktivitetsloggen** en uforanderlig liste over tidsstemplede oppføringer av bestemte typer som viser historikken til en dialog gjennom dens levetid [1]. Den inneholder informasjon om tidligere aktiviteter knyttet til den spesifikke dialogen, for eksempel opprettelse av dialogen, meldinger sendt fra tjenesteeieren, data innlevert av parten, signaturer eller betalinger samt åpning og/eller lesbekrefting av forsendelser [1].\n\nDet er **tjenesteeieren** som fyller ut aktivitetsloggen og har det overordnede ansvaret for dette [1] [2]. Tjenesteeieren bør gjøre oppdateringer i loggen samtidig med andre endringer som gjøres i dialogen [3]. \n\n*Merk:* Det skal ikke legges til en egen aktivitetsloggoppføring når nye forsendelser legges til, siden listen over forsendelser allerede er uforanderlig og fungerer som en logg i seg selv [4].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-dialog-01-aktivitetslogg", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 385, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB+read-hi", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dfd39a68c8de7 R19.9 P3.6 h3.0 or1.9 L2058 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Activity log", :response-chars 859, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :enrichment-hits 52, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8056, :pool-head "", :repeat 2, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :expected-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :elapsed-ms 218015, :issued-queries "aktivitetslogg dialog porten | aktivitetlogget i Dialogporten | hvem fyller aktivitetslogg dialog", :timestamp "2026-06-11T16:38:25.890285Z", :total-tokens 8441, :run-id "efe5bcc1-61db-42fd-b6ac-76e29f291a11", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Based on the provided documentation:\n\n**What 'seen' means:** In Dialogporten's `sett-logg` (\"seen log\"), a dialog being marked as `'seen'` specifically means that its unique dialogue ID has been requested via an API call[1]. This status only provides hints about which users have access to or retrieved the dialogue, but it does not confirm whether the content was read, understood, attachments were downloaded, or if any actions were taken (for those details, you must refer to the `aktivitetsloggen` / activity log instead)[1].\n\n**Do listing or searching count?** No. The documentation explicitly states that using the list API (`liste-API-et`) or search API (`søke-API-et`) will not populate or update the seen log[1]. \n\nAll definitions and system behaviors are derived directly from the provided text[1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? false, :question-id "ue-dialog-02-seen-log", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 415, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "snippet-AB", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features nil, :response-chars 808, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? false, :golden-pool-rank nil, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "de7113ac2875", :enrichment-hits 73, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8125, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "de7113ac2875", :expected-chunk-ids "bf583073feb1", :elapsed-ms 226319, :issued-queries "dialogportet dialog signatur | signalbaerern settlogg markert som lest | mottatt meldinger visning oppsummering", :timestamp "2026-06-11T16:39:58.965467Z", :total-tokens 8540, :run-id "6c311a72-b7ed-4772-b3a4-5ce50cb62c31", :golden-display-rank nil, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 0.0} {:response "In Dialogporten, a dialog being marked as **\"seen\"** specifically means that a particular `dialog ID` has been requested from the API (specifically via the dialog details endpoint) `[1][2]`. \n\nUsing **list** or **search** APIs does not count. Search/list operations will neither populate nor create entries in the seen log, and only requests to fetch specific dialog details trigger it `[1][2]`.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-dialog-02-seen-log", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 483, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB+read-hi", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d7d5b35931f86 R20.2 P3.7 h3.0 or1.7 L1534 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Seen log", :response-chars 395, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "bf583073feb1;de7113ac2875;9ea39131ccf7", :enrichment-hits 43, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 7908, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "bf583073feb1;9ea39131ccf7", :expected-chunk-ids "bf583073feb1", :elapsed-ms 237655, :issued-queries "Dialogporten seen markering | Dialogporten seelog sett melding sett | dialog seen status list vs view opening", :timestamp "2026-06-11T16:41:20.324203Z", :total-tokens 8391, :run-id "6bf84273-7e40-4668-83e8-07c8fac0bf07", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Based on the provided context, here is what it means for a dialog to be marked as `sett` (`seen`) in Dialogporten:\n\n- **Exact meaning of \"sett\" (`seen`):** In this specific technical context, having a dialog flagged as `sett` simply means that a specific `dialog-ID` has been requested/fetched directly from the API (`en bestemt dialog-ID er blitt forespurt fra API-et`) [1]. This flag is completely automated and does not indicate whether any human actually read or understood the content, downloaded attachments, or performed other actions within the user interface [1].\n- **Do listing or searching count?** No. The documentation explicitly states that `Bruk av søke- eller liste-API-et fører ikke til at sett-loggen fylles ut` (\"Using the search (`søke-api`) or list API does not cause the seen log to be filled out\") [1]. Bulk retrieval operations are intentionally excluded from this tracking mechanism.\n\nAdditionally, `sett-loggoppføringer` (seen log entries) are logged per user per revision change, meaning only the very first access for a given dialog version is recorded until the service owner updates it again [1]. For broader activity and action history beyond mere API requests, you would need to consult the `aktivitetsloggen` (activity log) instead [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? false, :question-id "ue-dialog-02-seen-log", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 539, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "snippet-AB", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d7d5b35931f86 R12.3 P2.5 h2.0 or0.7 L1534 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Seen log", :response-chars 1269, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 31, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "de7113ac2875;cf6fec34994e;c0a62a9174d8", :enrichment-hits 62, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8171, :pool-head "d206533e990ad R20.2 P2.5 h2.0 or0.7 L1833 2/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Pre published ;; d25c6442790e3 R19.9 P2.5 h2.0 or0